; exit 0
; MM-LIFE-2c events 2 and 3, shipped, and owned temporaries: a value a
; function answers is one share the caller holds and hands back, so
; the shapes below reclaim EVERYTHING they build. Each line is the
; bytes the arena grew per iteration over 10,000 iterations, after a
; 1,000-iteration warm-up, and every line must read 0.
;
; Before 2026-08-21 the first three leaked 80, 80 and 80 bytes per
; iteration (a `fmtInt` result, a `strConcat` result, or both - born
; at count 0, never adopted, never released), and the doc declined
; the event pair at "285 retains for 8 releases and nothing
; reclaimed". What reclaims here is the combination the model lacked:
; a reference-returning function ADOPTS a free-floating result
; (retains it to 1 - `strWrapOwned`'s `cast String` of a raw
; allocation), a borrowed tail leaf is retained where it is produced,
; a `let` bound to such a call releases at scope end, a temporary
; passed to a callee that neither stashes nor answers it is released
; after the call, and a temporary a constructor's reference field
; retained is released after the store.
;
;   shape 0: a record with a String field, built from a `fmtInt` and a
;            `strConcat`, read through an accessor, dropped
;   shape 1: `(strLen (fmtInt i))` - a temporary to a word-result callee
;   shape 2: a `let`-bound `strConcat`, measured, dropped
;   shape 3: a record with a static String field, read, dropped
;   shape 4: `(Some (fmtInt i))` matched and its binder measured - a
;            reference in a type-variable field, retained under its
;            witness, released with the block
;   shape 5: a String answered BORROWED (a parameter's field) through
;            two helpers and consumed
;
; The arena's BUMP WORD is the honest instrument: RSS hides reuse,
; and a count-word read takes no share of its own. It is the mark
; cell's word 0 - not the cell's address, which is a 24-byte block
; the allocator hands out from a free list once anything that size
; has died, so two cells' addresses say nothing about growth once
; reclamation works (this fixture compared the addresses until
; 2026-08-22, and read 0 by the accident of the same block coming
; back). Word 2 is the chunk: a growth that crossed into a new chunk
; answers 999999 rather than a difference of two unrelated bumps.
(import IO)
(import Str)
(pub struct Rec (n : Int) (name : String))
(:: nameOf (-> Rec String))
(fn (nameOf r) r.name)
(:: nameOf2 (-> Rec String))
(fn (nameOf2 r) (nameOf r))
(:: s0 (-> Int Int))
(fn (s0 i) (let ((r (Rec i (strConcat "nm-" (fmtInt i))))) (strLen (nameOf r))))
(:: s1 (-> Int Int))
(fn (s1 i) (strLen (fmtInt i)))
(:: s2 (-> Int Int))
(fn (s2 i) (let ((s (strConcat "nm-" (fmtInt i)))) (strLen s)))
(:: s3 (-> Int Int))
(fn (s3 i) (let ((r (Rec i "lit"))) (+ (strLen r.name) r.n)))
(:: s4 (-> Int Int))
(fn (s4 i) (match (Some (fmtInt i)) ((Some s) (strLen s)) ((None) 0)))
(:: s5 (-> Int Int))
(fn (s5 i) (let ((r (Rec i (fmtInt i)))) (strLen (nameOf2 r))))
(:: run (-> Int Int Int))
(fn (run which n)
  (let ((mut i 0) (mut acc 0))
    { (while (< i n)
        { (set acc (+ acc (if (== which 0) (s0 i)
                          (if (== which 1) (s1 i)
                          (if (== which 2) (s2 i)
                          (if (== which 3) (s3 i)
                          (if (== which 4) (s4 i) (s5 i))))))))
          (set i (+ i 1)) })
      acc }))
(:: measure (-> Int Int))
(fn (measure which)
  { (run which 1000)
    (let ((m0 (__axiom_arena_mark)))
      { (run which 10000)
        (let ((m1 (__axiom_arena_mark)))
          (if (!= (__load64 m1 2) (__load64 m0 2))
              999999
              (/ (- (__load64 m1 0) (__load64 m0 0)) 10000))) }) })
(:: main Int)
;@axiom:effect(io)
(fn (main)
  (let ((mut w 0))
    { (while (< w 6)
        { (println (measure w))
          (set w (+ w 1)) })
      0 }))
